              "text": "desempeñar — \"to carry out, to perform; to hold (a post)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Desempeña un papel importante en la empresa. She plays an important role in the company."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Desempeñar un cargo — to hold a post."
            }
          ]
        },
