          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "desempeñar is built on empeñar 'to pawn' with des-. Empeñar goes with empeño 'a pledge', which EtymDB traces to Latin in pignus 'in pledge'. To redeem a pledge became to carry out a duty."
            }
          ]
        },
